  "title": "UN Fact-Finding Mission Suggests US Was Behind Iran School Bombing",
  "summary": "The UN fact-finding mission has determined that the US military's actions in February in Iran's Minab province, targeting a school and sports facility, constituted war crimes, and that the US was involved in the attacks.",
